# Easy Steps (`#how`) — white-green accordion

Source of truth: `local_docs/WHITE_GREEN_DESIGN/White-green design.txt` (landing block 4)
and Figma screenshots `landing/4/` / `fix/1/figma.png`.

Do **not** modify this file unless the user explicitly asks for Easy Steps / `#how` changes.

## Section title

- `app-header-h3` + `text-title` (`--title-color`), centered
- Content: `easyStepsContent.title` from `landing.ts`

## Layout

Staggered rows across the marketing width (`justify-start` / `justify-center` / `justify-end`):

- Section bg: `page-bg`
- Each step is a full-width flex row; card aligned left → center → right
- Card width: `w-[83%] min-[600px]:w-[577px] bp840:w-[600px] shrink-0`
- Vertical spacing: `gap-5` between rows
- Do **not** wrap all cards in a narrow `max-w-[720px]` column (kills the stagger)

## Card chrome

- Background `#FFF`
- Radius `12px`
- Shadow `var(--landing-shadow)` (`0px 25px 100px 0px #45589D14`)
- Padding `20px`

## Card content

- Number badge PNGs: `landing/easy-steps/1.png`, `2.png`, `3.png` (synced from WHITE_GREEN `#1` / `#2` / `#3`)
- Number size: native aspect — `1.png` → `h-[101px] w-auto`; `2.png`/`3.png` → `h-[104px] w-auto` (never `h-10 w-10` square crop)
- Title: `app-header-h5` + `text-title`
- Body: collapsed by default; `app-text-p1-regular` + `neutral-theme-900` when open
- Expand/collapse via local `useState` per card (independent; all may be open)
- Closed icon: `landing/easy-steps/arrow-down.svg`
- Open icon: `landing/faq/faq_chevron_in_circle_up.svg`

## Assets

Synced via `pnpm sync-design` from `local_docs/WHITE_GREEN_DESIGN` → `public/landing/easy-steps/`.

## Anti-patterns

- Protruding step-2 photo (`-translate-y-1/2`) from NEW_GREEN
- Title `app-header-h4` + `text-action` (old green theme)
- Watermark digit overlays
- Always-visible body text without accordion
- Square-cropping number PNGs (`h-10 w-10`)
- Single centered `max-w-[720px]` stack (no horizontal stagger)
